      exitOutside: {x: 11.4, y: 5, z: 3.5}
    - number: 3
      sortCase: 3
      objective: "<b>Room 3  \xB7  worst case:</b>  dealt so that <b>every merge alternates</b> to the end.\n<b>Merge sort</b> the data blocks, smallest first.\nPress <b>SPLIT</b> until every block stands alone.  Then merge two runs at a time:  always take the <b>smaller front block</b>.\n<size=20>Q split  \xB7  click a glowing front block, or press 1 (left) / 2 (right)  \xB7  H hint</size>"
