      objective: "<b>Room 1  \xB7  best case:</b>  every pivot will land <b>in the middle</b>.\n<b>Quick sort</b> the gold bars, smallest first.\nRaise the <b>pivot</b> (the last bar).  Every other bar:  <b>smaller</b> goes behind the gate,  <b>bigger</b> stays.  Then drop the pivot into its place.\n<size=20>P pivot  \xB7  1 smaller  \xB7  2 bigger  \xB7  H hint</size>"
